  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Naturskyddsf&#xf6;reningen ram 2009 Syd + Info</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSNC  Frame 2009 South + Info</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A three year Framework Agreement for 2009-2011, with main focus of on strengthening of civil society in the area of environment and climate issues. The Programme is divided in several sub-programmes such as climate, water, forestry etc. Their is also a sub-program aimed at Eastern European countries that can be found under 54030029</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tre &#xe5;rigt ramavtal med Naturskyddsf&#xf6;reningen under perioden  2009-2011, som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka civila samh&#xe4;llen inom milj&#xf6; och klimat omr&#xe5;det. Programmet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven indelat i flera olika delprogram var av ett som riktar sig till &#xd6;steuropeiska l&#xe4;nder finns under komponent: 54030029</narrative>
  </description>
